     "title": "Ethics",
     "md": "**Copyright** protects the work of creators: do not copy or share their work without permission. Respect others online. **Cyberbullying** (hurtful messages or pictures) can seriously harm people; keep evidence, do not reply and tell a trusted adult."
    },
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "pieges",
     "title": "Mistakes",
     "md": "- Believing that antivirus alone is enough.\n- Sharing photos of others without permission.\n- Using the same password for all accounts."
    },
    {
     "type": "example",
     "title": "Example 1",
     "statement": "An unknown number sends a message that you won a phone and must pay a fee. What do you do?",
     "steps": [
      "It asks for money to give a prize: a typical fraud.",
      "Do not pay; do not click; tell an adult and block the sender."
     ],
     "answer": "Treat it as fraud."
    },
    {
     "type": "example",
     "title": "Example 2",
     "statement": "Which password is stronger: Buea2010 or k9#Tz!vR4p? Why?",
     "steps": [
      "Buea2010 uses a town name and a year, easy to guess.",
      "k9#Tz!vR4p is longer, mixed and not a real word."
     ],
     "answer": "k9#Tz!vR4p"
    }
